OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for drugging then
OL,4,Aabusing girlfriend
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottingham Crown Court was told police
OL,7,Farrested the man after he played five
OL,8,Fvideos of his offending to a sex
OL,9,Fworker, and said his "kink" was
OL,10,F"sexually abusing his girlfriend's
OL,11,Fsister while she was asleep".
OL,13,FOn Thursday, he was sentenced to 12
OL,14,Fyears in prison.
